@support_barrios
title: Support Martínez Barrios
view-if: prrs_relation >= 65 and psoe_in_government == 1
on-arrival: prrs_relation += 5; ar_relation += 5; prr_relation += 15; caballeristas_dissent += 5; workers_psoe -= 3; middle_psoe += 3; prr_leader = "Martínez Barrios"

Against the loud protests of Largo Caballero’s revolutionary wing, the PSOE National Committee approves parliamentary support for Martínez Barrios. 

While radical workers and peasants accuse us of traition, supporting this government is the lesser evil when the alternative is a CEDA-lead government.

- @continue: By any votes necessary.

